{"overview":"پروفسور سِه‌جونگ در یک کابوس خونی گرفتار می‌شود وقتی ویروسی به سرعت جهش می‌یابد و در کنفرانس بیوتکنولوژی رها می‌شود؛ مقامات ساختمان را محصور می‌کنند. سِه‌جونگ به همراه گروهی کوچک از بازماندگان، بدون راه فرار، باید برای زنده ماندن مبارزه کند در حالی که افراد مبتلا به تبدیل‌های وحشتناک می‌رسند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.","tagline_en":"Survive the hive.","runtime":123,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["یئون سانگ هو"],"crew_en":["Yeon Sang-ho"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"جون جی هیون","role":"Kwon Se-jeong","photo":"/qejOQBdIzN18e69yRcsiD0JQi4c.jpg","en":"Gianna Jun"},{"name":"구교환","role":"Seo Young-cheol","photo":"/aFwCpSKPGFqoiTStY6ljXnD5CwH.jpg","en":"Koo Kyo-hwan"},{"name":"지창욱","role":"Choi Hyun-seok","photo":"/sBmHrO5Tn27Ot5hy0yAKniROmNb.jpg","en":"Ji Chang-wook"},{"name":"김신록","role":"Choi Hyun-hee","photo":"/x4zo2mSbehnQY80PbuldAZ7ruGm.jpg","en":"Kim Shin-rock"},{"name":"신현빈","role":"Kong Seol-hee","photo":"/lU0yMFh5KgOEWZRThLYbB6ZI1hE.jpg","en":"Shin Hyun-been"},{"name":"고수","role":"Han Kyu-seong","photo":"/77209yRtUHOEk3ILJY1rG3X3VUj.jpg","en":"Go Soo"},{"name":"이중옥","role":"Lee Bong-seok","photo":"/fMkBpHRElwNatevfGinSv248bYg.jpg","en":"Lee Joong-ok"},{"name":"김종태","role":"Kang Woo-cheol","photo":"/vf3R5QU7UCVEr3dOGt3bdFbypzu.jpg","en":"Kim Jong-tae"},{"name":"황재열","role":"Citizen","photo":"/cyEibdvqNRurcNC63gqDSvX1qzE.jpg","en":"Hwang Jae-yeol"},{"name":"이담희","role":"Lee So-eun","photo":"/wGiJAT7w7r3VBZdTXClfEQZ9IOV.jpg","en":"Lee Dam-hee"},{"name":"채서은","role":"Bully Girl","photo":"/gwEVDlcIO5kGrKbhyDcTiL95zaO.jpg","en":"Chae Seo-eun"},{"name":"김성","role":"Bully Boy","photo":"","en":"Kim Sung"}],